1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,500
Pasting a live incident log into a cloud LLM leaks API keys, medical notes, password hints, and M&A secrets before anyone notices.

2
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:15,500
LocalFirst Triage v4 is a zero-leakage hybrid AI incident copilot built on the $0 Firebase Spark tier across Web PWA, a Chrome Extension, and Native Android.

3
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:25,000
Let's inspect the architecture end to end on Chrome 158 with GPU-accelerated Gemini Nano 4 and live Firebase AI Logic.

4
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Here in Scenario 1, Stage 1 runs Gemini Nano 4 via InferenceMode.ONLY_ON_DEVICE alongside our deterministic Defense-in-Depth Union.

5
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Even when an on-device model extracts only the first person name, our regex, Shannon entropy, policy term, and heuristic guards always run in union underneath.

6
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Clinical ICU notes, apostrophe-containing password hints, M&A valuations, JWTs, and API keys are all masked locally before anything reaches the network.

7
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Interactive diff pills and text selection let engineers audit every mask during a cancelable pre-cloud window—or fail closed into Quarantine on standard browsers.

8
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:16,000
In Zero-Leakage Proof, verifyZeroLeakage audits raw, URL-encoded, JSON-escaped, and merged constituent spans before Cloud Gemini streams Root Cause Analysis.

9
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:26,000
For leadership updates, Hybrid Stakeholder Brief uses InferenceMode.PREFER_ON_DEVICE—generating briefs on Nano 4 when ready or falling back cleanly to Cloud.

10
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Every step enforces zero raw PII retention in IndexedDB or Firestore, purging source strings to [PURGED_FROM_DISK_FOR_PRIVACY].

11
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:46,500
Toggle Airplane Mode and all six built-in P2 and P3 runbooks resolve completely offline at zero cloud token cost while blocking outbound escalation.

12
00:01:46,500 --> 00:01:58,000
Firebase Remote Config updates cloud models, Shannon entropy thresholds, and enterprise blocked codenames live without redeploying the app.

13
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Engineers on GitHub or Jira can also highlight logs in our Manifest V3 Extension Side Panel, sanitizing locally before safe #handoff= transfer.

14
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:23,000
On Native Android, Jetpack Compose runs the exact same Defense-in-Depth firewall, six runbooks, firebase-ai-ondevice client, and Play Integrity App Check.

15
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:35,000
Guest or Google Sign-In lazy-loads Cloud Firestore to sync strictly Zero-PII tickets across Web and Android, guarded by RE2 Firestore Security Rules.

16
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:45,000
LocalFirst Triage v4—tested across 72 Web tests, 9 Playwright E2E flows, and 10 Android JUnit suites. Privacy first, on-device first.
